  "slug": "what-to-eat-today",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/19650_what-to-eat-today.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "This morning I said: Mom, I want to eat bread, hamburger and Coke for breakfast. Mom said: No, you can only eat bread, eggs and hot milk. I said: Can I have burgers and Coke for lunch? Mom said: You can eat hamburgers for lunch, but you can’t drink Coke. I said: OK."
  ],
  "english_full": "This morning I said: Mom, I want to eat bread, hamburger and Coke for breakfast. Mom said: No, you can only eat bread, eggs and hot milk. I said: Can I have burgers and Coke for lunch? Mom said: You can eat hamburgers for lunch, but you can’t drink Coke. I said: OK.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Сего́дня у́тром я ска́зал: Мама, я жела́ю ку́шать хлеб, га́мбургер и ко́ку на за́втрак. Мама ска́зала: Нет, ты можешь ку́шать только хлеб, яйцо́ и жа́ркое молоко."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Segodnya útrom ya skazál: Mama, ya zheláyu kúshat' khleb, gámburger i kóku na závtrak. Mama skazála: Net, ty mozesh' kúshat' tol'ko khleb, yaytso i zhaŕkoe moloko."
  ],
